        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia D0806LAC Modern Low Profile Double Cylinder Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOmnia's low profile modern style double cylinder deadbolt kit has many features which ensure a product of high security. The exterior and interior collars are made of solid forged brass with a very low 3/8 inch projection off the door. The 1 inch deadbolt has saw-proof inserts. It includes an armored reinforced strike plate with 3 inch long screws for additional security.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/low-profile-modern-deadbolt-omnia-d0806la\"><b>Omnia D0806LA Low Profile Modern Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFits 1-3/4\" thick doors with standard 2-1/8\" door prep. Deadbolt kit includes 2 lock cylinders with collars, deadbolt assembly, faceplate, and strike plate.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia D0806LAC Low Profile Modern Double Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Available with 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" Backset</li>\r\n<li>Fits Standard 2-1/8\" Bore Hole</li>\r\n<li>For <b>1-3/4\" Thick Doors</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Low Profile Double Cylinder Deadbolt</b>. A key is used to unlock and lock the door from both outside and inside. Do not use on Fire or Emergency exit doors. Available in 9 different finishes. \r\n</p>",
