                "description": "Omnia D0806LAC - Omnia's low profile modern style double cylinder deadbolt kit has many features which ensure a product of high security. The exterior and interior collars are made of solid forged brass with a very low 3/8 inch projection off the door. The 1 inch deadbolt has saw-proof inserts. It includes an armored reinforced strike plate with 3 inch long screws for additional security.\r\n",
